One binary, one input, geometry by spall.seed_void (a multiple of 6 ints).
⚠ The top Robin flux is zeroed (T_flame = the rock IC), so the vertical
criterion fires nothing and every firing here is the lateral mode's. The side
faces are heated through the explicit (side_face_h, side_face_T) pair.

⚠ All assertions are on INTERIOR columns: a column touching a domain plane has a
different open-face count by construction (the quarter-domain mirror), so
plane-adjacent columns deviate for a reason that is not the stencil.
"""
