                 "%s worst |ledger_err_solid| %.3e <= 5e-3" % (leg, max(v)))

    # ---- (a1)'s cell-form half, by source assertion -----------------------
    # ⚠ HONEST LIMITATION: the lateral path only ever calls SurfaceCellFlux with
