                 "the KERNEL'S OWN h (err %.2e) -- it now reads the temperature "
                 "the flux produced" % err)
            L_cap, L_true = Tf_cap - Tc_true, Tf_true - Tc_true
            print("     LIFT above the cell: capped %.4f K  ->  uncapped %.4f K"
