    # ======================================================================
    # P1g-2c: THE THERMAL SHIFT'S WRITE-BACK -- two legs that did not exist
    # ======================================================================
    # ⚠⚠ WHY THESE LEGS ARE NEW. Before this step `spall.lateral_thermal`
