    #   n =  8  ->  5 <= j <= 2   EMPTY: every corner refuses, leg is VACUOUS
    #   n = 20  ->  5 <= j <= 14  10 shifting corners
    #   n = 32  ->  5 <= j <= 26  22 shifting corners
    # n = 20 is used. All corners are equivalent so they bank in the SAME step,
